[{"client_msg_id":"5f48ae83-a7b0-4613-b628-405744939d0a","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"ubuntuってデフォのnvidiaドライバ決まってるんですかね\nヌーヴォーで駄目ならプロプラ、逆なら逆で試せば変わりそう","ts":"1621436269.024900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kBUD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"78f4bb15-91fe-4c00-a1d7-7f55cc45f740","type":"message","user":"U01U44T1FK2","text":"観測した限りArchで動くし、Debianで動くし問題なしって感じかな\nLinuxとNvidiaが仲が悪いっていうより、Ubuntu固有のものなんだろうか...\n物理的なパーツ相性問題も大いに可能性あるけど。検証できるほどリソース豊富じゃないから現実的では無い\n\n自作したい欲があるのでそのときにRadeonを買ってNvidia vs AMD vs Intel(オンボ)をしようかな","ts":"1621436131.024100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"iVs"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6aa3dedc-1d6c-4c1d-8c5a-6161d08f8dd5","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"Arch機でGTX1070使ってますね\nまあオンボでもいいといえばそうなんですがデュアルブートのWindowsでたまにゲームするので","ts":"1621425902.018600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Ze9w"}]},{"client_msg_id":"209f9f9d-a714-4b3e-80b6-fa754a6bf012","type":"message","user":"UQX22KG9F","text":"いつもファンレスの買ってる…いまのマシンはGT710かな。ドライバはnouveauで済ませてる。\n勝手な印象でRadeonのほうがハマりそうとNvidia買ってる。","ts":"1621425322.017800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ZcH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0cb77eb5-c0cf-4adc-b959-a76fa3b1fd89","type":"message","user":"UNJ2DANJC","text":"GTX750tiっていう名機持ってる","ts":"1621424482.016100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"QI9k"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3b0835fb-197c-4c4b-bcee-9540359d0f2a","type":"message","user":"U8CC7MDCL","text":"x16スロ2本必須になってしまうからitxとか小型PC組めない…","ts":"1621422308.015400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vFmeH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7f10170c-3a81-40db-b97e-4de06b1bdfab","type